sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Storefront as Storefront
	participant Chat as Chat API
	participant Foundry as Microsoft Foundry
	participant Presidio as Presidio
	participant MCP as MCP Tools
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant Rating as Rating API
	participant Session as Conversation State

	Storefront ->> Chat: Synchronous chat turn
	Chat ->> Session: Load conversation state
	Chat ->> Chat: Validate prompt and caller

	alt Unsafe or out-of-scope prompt
		Chat -->> Storefront: Bounded rejection
	else Accepted prompt
		Chat ->> Foundry: Synchronous route decision
		Foundry -->> Chat: Book, policy, or rating route

		opt Intent needs clarification
			Chat -->> Storefront: Synchronous disambiguation request
			Storefront ->> Chat: Clarified route
		end

		alt Book or policy specialist
			Chat ->> Presidio: Synchronous PII anonymization
			Presidio -->> Chat: Sanitized prompt
			Chat ->> Foundry: Synchronous specialist request
			Foundry ->> MCP: Read-only tool call
			MCP ->> Catalog: Synchronous catalog read
			Catalog -->> MCP: Grounding facts
			MCP -->> Foundry: Tool result
		else Rating specialist
			Chat ->> Rating: Synchronous review request
			Rating -->> Chat: Grounded review summary
		end

		Chat ->> Presidio: Synchronous output filtering
		Presidio -->> Chat: Filtered response
		Chat ->> Session: Persist updated state
		Chat -->> Storefront: Stream response
	end
